# Copy to web/.env.local (git-ignored) only if you need to change something. The web app holds
# no keys: the PayPal client ID comes from the server (GET /api/config), never from this file.
#
# Where the map gets its market: auto (the server when it answers, else the in-browser market),
# server or mock. The URL switch ?backend=server|mock wins over this.
VITE_BACKEND=auto
#
# Base URL of the HoldMySpot API. Empty means the same origin, through the dev server's /api proxy.
VITE_HMS_API=
#
# Where the dev server's /api proxy points (default http://127.0.0.1:8796). `npm run demo` at the
# repo root sets it to the server it starts.
# HMS_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:8796
